"""Minimal ECA primitive synthesis loop.

The loop connects frame-only action-effect memory to primitive selection and a
small executor policy. It is deliberately conservative: it probes first, then
uses the selected primitive to choose the next generic action. It does not
contain per-game plans or environment-internal reads.
"""
